generics3,25,"//// [tests/cases/compiler/generics3.ts] ////\n\n=== generics3.ts ===\nclass C<T> { private x: T; }\n>C : typeof C\n>T : any\n>x : any\n\ninterface X { f(): string; }\n>f : any\n\ninterface Y { f(): string; }\n>f : any\n\nvar a: C<X>;\n>a : C<X>\n\nvar b: C<Y>;\n>b : C<Y>\n\na = b; // Ok - should be identical\n>a = b : C<Y>\n>a : C<X>\n>b : C<Y>\n\n"
