ny`\n>zz.push(logLength(42)) : any\n>zz.push : any\n>zz : any[]\n>push : any\n>logLength(42) : string\n>logLength : <T extends string, U extends string>(arg: ({ [K in U]: any; })[U]) => T\n>42 : 42\n\nzz = logFirstLength([42]);  // no error; T is inferred as `any[]`\n>zz = logFirstLength([42]) : any[]\n>zz : string[]\n>logFirstLength([42]) : any[]\n>logFirstLength : <T extends string[], U extends string>(arg: ({ [K in U]: any; })[U]) => T\n>[42] : number[]\n>42 : 42\n\n"
